<bioghist encodinganalog="545$a">
<head>Biographical/Historical Information 
</head>
<p>The Stony Point Ruritan Club in Albemarle County, Virginia was chartered in 1962.
</p>
</bioghist>

<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>This is a collection of materials from the Stony Point Ruritan Club and includes photos, horse show programs, a copy of the 1962 charter, and promotional materials. Folders 6-19 are from 3-paneled display boards.
</p>
</scopecontent>

